I was just thinking, it'd be fun to have a regular column/box-out in
the webzine that covers little-known facts about Nethack and other
Roguelikes.  Here are some starters (that I've only noticed just
recently after playing Nethack for years)

* If you confuse a long worm, it can bite and kill itself.
* A quantum mechanic can drop a box containing a corpse of a cat named
Schroedinger.
* Shriekers have a small chance of attracting a purple worm.
Etc. ...

